# armour/shared/pauldron_slab6_l: the legend SLAB pauldron on the left shoulder (slab.6; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# a flat-topped slab plate grown to the legend size, square corners, its lip lit, a lame under its seam (the BROAD
# mass).
# 6 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (28 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the slab's lip, P the plate, N the seam.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron slab.6
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

